'''Avalugg''' (Japanese: '''クレベース''' ''Crebase'') is a {{ct|Water}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

