==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Evolving Skies|Avalugg|45}} from the {{TCG|Evolving Skies}} expansion; both cards have the Frost Barrier attack.
*'''Frost Barrier''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Flashfire|Avalugg|31}} from the {{TCG|Flashfire}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

